WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.600
Wólem májdym uním k'ódo 'ymítdom,

2
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:15.200
'Ínjanà wi'ípem k'ódojdì k'ódom'Íynnan,

3
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.800
momím jymmotòpem kíwnan 'ysítopindom,

4
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.440
'uním k'ódo 'ymítwonòm

5
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.760
'Adóm 'uním k'ódo 'ékdadòjkynan,

6
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:27.120
'yc'ópindom, 'yc'ópindom,

7
00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:36.880
kak'án 'uním k'ódo'éswomìtdom.

8
00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:42.520
'Adóm 'Ínjanàm májdym kawónom

9
00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.600
'uním k'ódi bíspem.

10
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:48.000
'Ínjanàm.

11
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.800
'Amá, wóham hadójpem kalétani 'ymítdom,

12
00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.600
'amá 'Ínjanàm, jawídom,

13
00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:59.000
immigrant 'awónom.

14
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.120
'Amám, 'ysítopindom 'uním k'ódo,

15
00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:02.560
Hanílèkim Kojóm 'ysíto

16
00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:05.720
Smoke Creek Nevadadi ysítopindom,

17
00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:06.920
bó jawónom kak'án.

18
00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.840
Bóm.

19
00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:11.280
'Ánt'ytyt'ym 'ó wokít 'ynódom,

20
00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:12.560
hanysitopìnwonom.

21
00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:14.560
Kak'án wowókinùpem 'ac'éki.

22
00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:17.640
'Amá kak'ás c'ewónom.

23
00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:21.320
'Amám, 'yc'ópindom,

24
00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:23.360
Smoke Creek di 'yc'ópindom,

25
00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:25.080
'óm jamáni 'ysítopindom,

26
00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:27.160
Podápem K'ódojdi,

27
00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:29.360
Wipúppùm K'ódojdi 'yc'ópinwonom,

28
00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:33.160
Hanílèkim Kojóna 'éswomìtdom.

29
00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:36.440
'Amá, mín k'a'ájk'asì.

30
00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:38.080
C'àjìm wónom májdym

31
00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:40.440
nìk'í hònwe pínjahàmyni,

32
00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:41.600
mín japájtodom.

33
00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:47.000
'Amám, 'ypìndom,

34
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:53.320
'uním sèwí, 'uním betém séwwonpinì,

35
00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:55.400
'uním nák'am k'ódonan 'yc'ópindom,

36
00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:58.000
'uním sèwí 'ynnowònom.

37
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.480
'Adóm 'ódo hatámwonòm, 'ódo bádom.

38
00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:05.200
'Amyni, 'Ínjanàm tawáltiwònom Wóle.

39
00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:07.920
Hójjam Wóle.

40
00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:16.240
'Adóm Wólem uním k'ódo ymítwonom.

41
00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:22.800
'Adóm uním k'ódo ýpinwonom.

42
00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.080
Uním jamánim ýnno,

43
00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.920
sewí ýpinwonom.

44
00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:33.560
Amádi mac'ój'am:

45
00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:37.120
méjtom hybó kywónom.

46
00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:40.000
C'í, damísa sélwonom.

47
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.480
Amádi mac'ój'am:

48
00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:46.720
nikbék'ym, tawáljat'an ypíndom;

49
00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:49.640
'ódom dúki, ándykbe ma'at, 'ájk'ate,

50
00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:54.720
maha'okitdom nikbék'yjat'am.

51
00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:58.560
Amýni, mym 'ódom dúki Wóle c'etíwonom

52
00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:00.640
Amýni mac'ój'am:

53
00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:03.960
méjdom Wólem, istówakypem Wólem,

54
00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:05.720
jalálapdojdom,

55
00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:08.960
sýttim kamísa hápdawweten,

56
00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:10.160
ódom dúkini.

57
00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:20.280
Awónom kak'án nikbewk'yjat'am.

58
00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:25.080
Amám uním sewí tawál ýpnnowonom,

59
00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:30.000
Adóm, nikbewk'yjat'am.

60
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:36.960
Amám kíwnan c'ajím májdym yc'ópinwonom,

61
00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:40.240
Pámwilim májdym.

62
00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:45.240
Amádi kak'án, nikbewk'yjat'am tawálwonom.

63
00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:51.640
Adóm nikbewk'yjat'am Pánwylim wéje mákkitwonom.

64
00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:56.720
Adóm pack train ak'án nikbewk'yjat'am.

65
00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:59.440
K'a'aj ky'ým ma'ám.

66
00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:04.320
Pack train, pack animal ka'ájk'an.

67
00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:07.920
Ka'ájk'as, wéjedom.

68
00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:16.600
Wóleni wéjec'yjdom, is kinda tangled up ak'án Wólem.

69
00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:20.280
Amýni, Ínjanani ka'ájk'as, wéjedom.

70
00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.680
Uním séwbonpinim,

71
00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:26.600
Cariboum sewím piní,

72
00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.720
Sájnem májdym ódo tawálwonom

73
00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:32.160
Syhýlim séwdi.

74
00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:34.720
Obýnodi unídi,

75
00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:36.120
ódo tawáldom,

76
00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:38.920
sewí luk'ú píkno tawáldom,

77
00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.280
ó unína wulútdojwonom.

78
00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:47.720
Amýni, mac'ój'am: líjani, ódo pí hýjewonom.

79
00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:54.480
Adóm mac'ój'am: tawál'ysipwonom.

80
00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.600
Adóm uním séwno momí kutídom,

81
00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:00.520
t'úc'ikdom sewí,

82
00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:05.880
ódo tawálwonom,

83
00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:06.840
wájodom,

84
00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:09.920
pulúmna wájodom,

85
00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:10.680
wájodom.

86
00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:12.840
Sájnem májdym.

87
00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:20.880
Adóm uním sewí tawál'ýnnowónom, mac'ój'am.

